why The Night Elf priest spells: Starshards at 10, Elune's Grace at 20.

# The Night Elf Priest spell quests: Stars of Elune at 10 (5627, Starshards)
# and Elune's Grace at 20 (5672), both from Priestess Alathea in the Temple
# of the Moon in Darnassus.
# Sources: quests.json and npcs.json for the givers; Forever's
# Priest class quest list (data/local/quest-audit/:
# both unchanged; Elune's Grace 5674 now also starts at Nara Meideros);
# classicwowforever.com/racials and wowclassicforever.info/classes/priest
# for the spells (Starshards and Elune's Grace stay Night Elf spells).
# alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil carries Starshards on the route (5629,
# Returning Home, from Laurna Morninglight in Dolanaar) and
# alliance/04-redridge-mountains and 06-ashenvale carry Elune's Grace (5673,
# from High Priestess Laurena); this guide repeats them for anyone off the
# route. The game offers one quest of each set.
# Not checked in game: written from the sources above.

step Stars of Elune
  tip At 10, go to Priestess Alathea in the Temple of the Moon. Priest trainers elsewhere (Laurna Morninglight in Dolanaar, Priestess Josetta in Goldshire, Maxan Anvol in Kharanos) send you to her with Returning Home.
  level 10
  accept 5627                                 -- Priestess Alathea
  turnin 5627                                 -- Priestess Alathea: Starshards

step Elune's Grace
  tip At 20, Priestess Alathea teaches Elune's Grace. High Priestess Laurena in Stormwind and High Priest Rohan in Ironforge send you to her with a quest of the same name.
  level 20
  accept 5672                                 -- Priestess Alathea
  turnin 5672                                 -- Priestess Alathea: Elune's Grace
